1
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,660
The poison seeped straight from his lying teeth,

2
00:00:30,769 --> 00:00:32,979
I tore the heavy locks right off the doorframe!

3
00:00:33,109 --> 00:00:35,439
No logic left, no boy to hide behind or beg,

4
00:00:35,609 --> 00:00:38,649
Just pure, blind slaughter in a savage game!

5
00:00:38,689 --> 00:00:41,369
I am the primal urge in your blood,

6
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,590
The claws burrowing through flesh and mud!

7
00:00:43,679 --> 00:00:45,780
I stand forever as your living shield,

8
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:50,020
To take them down and never—ever—yield!

9
00:00:57,460 --> 00:01:00,289
He struck at broken ribs to shatter our spine,

10
00:01:00,409 --> 00:01:02,780
A cowardly blow meant to break us apart!

11
00:01:02,869 --> 00:01:04,680
I swallowed all the pain whole,

12
00:01:04,769 --> 00:01:07,170
And tore him to shreds while he wept for your sake!

13
00:01:07,269 --> 00:01:09,930
I smashed his arrogant skull against the steel,

14
00:01:10,010 --> 00:01:12,140
I squeezed the breath from his filthy throat!

15
00:01:12,219 --> 00:01:14,549
I dragged that piece of shit through the dust,

16
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:18,219
To stifle his laughter in a suffocating ditch!

17
00:01:26,299 --> 00:01:28,819
The clothing racks shattered with a terrifying crash,

18
00:01:28,909 --> 00:01:31,209
He crawled away, begging on his knees!

19
00:01:31,290 --> 00:01:33,170
He ran weeping through the freezing street,

20
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:36,030
Before I tore him to fucking pieces!

21
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:38,829
I am the awakened rage that breaks the chain,

22
00:01:38,890 --> 00:01:41,060
The predator feeding on their pain!

23
00:01:41,170 --> 00:01:43,379
I stand between the shadows and your heart,

24
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,980
And tear his wretched flesh apart!

25
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:57,950
Logic is dead, the cage has crumbled to dust,

26
00:01:58,049 --> 00:02:00,189
You collapse, gasping, to the ground.

27
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:02,569
My claws drip with his shattered pride,

28
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,859
And I remain locked up no longer!